    {
      "text": "The balance sheet provides capacity for investment: at September 26, 2026, AMD had $7.4B cash, $8.4B short-term investments, and $7.1B debt; net debt after cash and short-term investments was -$8.7B. Current ratio was 2.72x. These measures indicate liquidity in the reported balance sheet, not the returns or timing of future investment. <<metric:financial-lens-financial-strength.cash|period>> <<metric:financial-lens-financial-strength.debt|period>> <<metric:financial-lens-financial-strength.netDebt|period>> <<metric:financial-lens-financial-strength.currentRatio|period>>",
