    {
      "text": "Bull case: strong EPYC and Instinct demand, the MI450 launch, accelerating Data Center segment profitability, and management’s Q4 commentary on Helios and Venice could sustain growth and operating leverage. These are evidence-based drivers, not assured outcomes.",
