    {
      "text": "Bear case: AI accelerator demand may not translate into deliveries at expected scale, while intense competition, product-launch execution, semiconductor cyclicality, customer-market conditions, and potential loss of a significant customer are risks AMD identifies in its filings. The elevated revenue multiple increases valuation sensitivity to any growth or margin disappointment.",
