      "text": "The margin expansion claim needs a base-effect qualification. Data Center operating margin was 31.3% for the nine months ended September 26, 2026, versus 16.4% in the prior-year period, but the comparison does not establish that the newer margin is sustainable as product mix and production scale change. The annual filing also describes prior export-control-related inventory charges, a potential distortion when interpreting historical margins. <<metric:segment-results.amd_DataCenterMember-2025-12-28-2026-09-26-margin|period>> <<metric:segment-results.amd_DataCenterMember-2024-12-29-2025-09-27-margin|period>>",
